    rdfs:comment "A policy that governs a group of related insurance policies under a single authority. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf InsuranceContract (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 2 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3."@en,
        "Master policy takes precedence in conflicts. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The master policy governs subordinate policies in conflicts, and its authority is expressed through 'ContractualProvision'. The doma…"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty li:MasterPolicyPrecedence ;
            owl:someValuesFrom li:ContractualProvision ],
        li:InsuranceContract ;
    skos:altLabel "Master Policy Authority"@en ;
    skos:definition "A policy that governs a group of related insurance policies under a single authority."@en .

