    rdfs:comment "An executive officer authorized to sign a life insurance policy on behalf of an organization. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf TITLE; cluster of 1 surface…"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf li:AuthorizedSignatory ;
    skos:definition "An executive officer authorized to sign a life insurance policy on behalf of an organization."@en .

li:PolicySplit a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Split Option"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A division of a life insurance policy into separate sections or portions. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf PolicyComponent (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 5 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3."@en,
        "Deadline exists for making split election. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies a 2-year deadline after the first death for splitting the policy, which aligns with the concept of a post-lapse…"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty li:SplitElectionDeadline ;
            owl:someValuesFrom li:DeadlineForElectiveActionPostLapse ],
        li:PolicyComponent ;
    skos:altLabel "policy division"@en,
        "policy split"@en ;
    skos:definition "A division of a life insurance policy into separate sections or portions."@en .

